{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004207","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004207"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004207","label":"樗里子（穰侯列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"樗里子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0005"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-072-rang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-072-rang:p003","quote":"樗里子"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"樗里子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004207","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-072-rang:p003","chapter_id":"c-shiji-072-rang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji072-012","person_id":"cbr-p004207","surfaces":["樗里子"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-072-rang"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-072-rang:p003","quote":"昭王七年，樗里子死，而使涇陽君質於齊。趙人樓緩來相秦，趙不利，乃使仇液之秦，請以魏冉為秦相。仇液將行，其客宋公謂液曰：「秦不聽公，樓緩必怨公。公不若謂樓緩曰『請為公毋急秦』。秦王見趙請相魏冉之不急，且不聽公。公言而事不成，以德樓子；事成，魏冉故德公矣。」於是仇液從之。而秦果免樓緩而魏冉相秦。"}],"rationale":"依前3段明示稱名與局部敘事暫接，魏冉穰侯與宣太后羋八子相配。武王后與武王分開，仇液公稱與內嵌樓緩受話的公稱分辨。異父同父同母各按相對敘事保留，不補父親名字；惠文后非宣太后，同姓族屬不全域接人物。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:p003","text":"昭王七年，樗里子死，而使涇陽君質於齊。趙人樓緩來相秦，趙不利，乃使仇液之秦，請以魏冉為秦相。仇液將行，其客宋公謂液曰：「秦不聽公，樓緩必怨公。公不若謂樓緩曰『請為公毋急秦』。秦王見趙請相魏冉之不急，且不聽公。公言而事不成，以德樓子；事成，魏冉故德公矣。」於是仇液從之。而秦果免樓緩而魏冉相秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004198","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"樗里子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004207","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0012","start":12